## Cup & Handle Detection Logic

### Algorithm

```
Input: 52-week RS line (array of 52 weekly values)

1. Find PEAK — highest RS line value in the window
2. Find TROUGH — lowest value before the peak
3. Cup Depth = (Peak − Trough) / Peak × 100
4. Find RIGHT SIDE — recovery from trough toward peak level
5. Right Rim = highest value on the right side
6. Right Rim Pct = Right Rim / Peak × 100

Cup valid if:
  - Depth 10–40%
  - ≥5 weeks from trough to right rim
  - Right rim ≥85% of left rim

7. Find HANDLE — price action after the right rim
8. Handle Depth = (Right Rim − Handle Low) / Right Rim × 100
9. Handle Location — must be above (Trough + Peak) / 2

Handle valid if:
  - Depth 2–12%
  - Duration 1–7 weeks
  - Location above cup midpoint
```

### Sparkline Colours

|Colour          |Meaning                             |
|----------------|------------------------------------|
|Purple `#c47aff`|Full Cup & Handle detected          |
|Amber `#ffb800` |Cup forming, handle not yet complete|
|Grey `#4a6080`  |No pattern detected                 |

