## All Filters Explained

|Filter           |What It Does                         |Recommended Setting                |
|-----------------|-------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|
|Universe         |Stock pool to scan                   |S&P 500 for large caps             |
|RS High Threshold|How close to 52-week RS high         |“New High” for strongest setups    |
|Sector           |Narrow to one sector                 |Use when sector is in leadership   |
|Min RS Rating    |Minimum percentile rank              |80+ for high-conviction setups     |
|ADR% Min         |Minimum daily volatility             |3% — removes dead stocks           |
|ADR% Max         |Maximum daily volatility             |15% — removes lottery tickets      |
|MCap Min         |Minimum market cap                   |$5B — removes micro caps           |
|MCap Max         |Maximum market cap                   |$500B or unlimited                 |
|C&H Only         |Require full Cup & Handle pattern    |Use for highest-quality setups     |
|Skip Earnings    |Exclude stocks with earnings ≤14 days|Always recommended for swing trades|

